  m_Name: 038-rokeya
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  characterName: Rokeya Chowdhury
  promptText: "My clothing brand sells as \u201Csustainable\u201D, but it runs on
    low-paid factory work. If I raise wages to a living standard, the factory may
    close and those mothers lose their income. Do I keep wages low to protect jobs,
    or raise them for dignity?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, hold wages for now; protect current incomes while you seek a fair
    transition.
  rightAnswer: No, raise wages to living pay, even if some jobs are lost; dignity
    matters.
